            "scene_context": "You cling precariously to a narrow ledge, the crimson rain blurring your vision. Below, the chasm yawns \u2013 a dizzying, swirling vortex of dark energy. Above, the ledge abruptly ends, leading to a massive, partially collapsed archway. Etched into the arch\u2019s surface are pulsating, crimson glyphs, radiating an oppressive heat. The spectral blade in your hand hums with an almost painful intensity as it draws in the ambient crimson energy, momentarily solidifying a fractured portion of the archway just ahead \u2013 enough for a leaping stride, but the effort leaves you visibly drained, a tremor running through your arm. Two gargoyles, larger than any you\u2019ve faced before, slowly rotate their heads towards you, their stone eyes glowing with malevolent light. They haven't moved to attack, as if waiting.",
